Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:15:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 03/10] feat(rlharness): DEBUG command; locate why the frame
 after RESET exits

DEBUG reports curState, gameplaySetupState, the setup subthread, globals, stage,
difficulty, shot type, isReplay/isDemo and the frame count.

Finding: after RESET the state is actually live -

  RESET  -> ready=1 setup_frames=80
  DEBUG  -> curState=2 (GameManager) setupState=0 (COMPLETE) subthread=0 globals=1
  STATE  -> lives=2.0 bombs=3.0 player=(192,384) rngSeed=1234

The real blocker is that the very next PumpOneFrame() returns false: the title
screen chain element is still in g_Chain and, seeing curState is no longer the
title state, asks to exit. That is the same root cause as the earlier
" episode ends at ~frame 329\.

This
